    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn are delighted to present this spacious three bedroom mid terrace home to the market, ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Barnwell development in Hansfield. Offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout, this superb property is presented in excellent condition and is perfectly suited to modern family living.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a generous lounge, and a spacious fully fitted kitchen/dining area that enjoys an abundance of natural light, with French doors opening onto the private rear garden. A guest W.C. / utility room completes the ground floor accommodation. Upstairs, the property offers three generously sized bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom with en-suite, together with a modern family bathroom. The upstairs landing gives access to the attic that is suitable for conversion, which could provide additional flexible living space upon completion. The well designed layout maximises space and functionality, creating a comfortable home ideal for first time buyers, growing families, or those looking to trade up.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from bay parking to the front, while the enclosed rear garden provides a private outdoor space ideal for relaxing and family enjoyment.\n\nBarnwell is one of Hansfield`s most desirable residential developments, renowned for its family friendly atmosphere and exceptional convenience. A wealth of amenities are within easy reach, including local shops, cafés, primary and secondary schools, playgrounds, parks, and sporting facilities. Hansfield Train Station is just a short stroll away, providing a regular service to Dublin City Centre, while the area is also well served by Dublin Bus routes. Nearby destinations include Ongar Village, Clonee, Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, the National Aquatic Centre, Dublin 15 Corporate Parks, the Phoenix Park, the N3/M50 motorway network, and Dublin Airport.\n\nCombining generous accommodation, a superb location, and excellent transport links, this is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a quality home in one of Dublin 15`s most popular residential locations.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 5.34m (17'6\") x 1.27m (4'2\")\nwith laminate wood floor, alarm panel & recessed lighting.\n\nLounge - 4.04m (13'3\") x 4.27m (14'0\")\nwith laminate wood floor, feature fireplace with timber surround, slate hearth & gas fire inset. Recessed lighting.\n\nKitchen / Diner\nL- shape with a range of floor & eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback. Integrated dishwasher, oven, gas hob & extractor fan. Recessed lighting & French doors to rear garden.\n\nGuest W.C. / Utility - 1.47m (4'10\") x 2.32m (7'7\")\nwith w.c & w.h.b. Fitted press units for additional storage. Plumbed for washing machine.\n\nLanding - 3.64m (11'11\") x 1.94m (6'4\")\nwith access to attic & hotpress.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.19m (10'6\") x 4.24m (13'11\")\nto rear of house with carpet & built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 1.08m (3'7\") x 2.61m (8'7\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b. with & shower cubicle.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.28m (10'9\") x 2.76m (9'1\")\nto front of house with laminate wood floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.28m (10'9\") x 2.55m (8'4\")\nto front of house with carpet.\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.68m (5'6\") x 2.51m (8'3\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., & bath with shower attachment.\n\n"
      },
